    "title": "挂单/取单教程",
    "keywords": "",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p><video src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202402/0be023af50e419d9736e847d3321f56b.mp4\" controls=\"controls\" class=\"my-video\" style=\"max-width:100%\">\n\n\n视频描述\n</video></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E6%8C%82%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">挂单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%8C%82%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>操作路径：左侧导航销售-销售-新增销售单，选中商品信息后，点击底部的挂单按钮即可挂单。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202309/eff43033c4a741400dfbc5e6f923fdd4.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E5%8F%96%E5%8D%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">取单<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%8F%96%E5%8D%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<p>在新开销售单界面没有选择商品的情况下，点击底部的取单按钮，可以查询到所有的挂单信息，可以删除和取单。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202309/3f63790b0913b227e39025dae7a1a6ec.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202309/1c104ceca281fea3310d97b1dae92670.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n",
